If you are an EUUG member, you can order it from the EUUG software
distribution centre at mcvax. It comes on the EUUG.D8 distribution
tape in tar format, 1600 fpi, 2400' reel, together with about
20 Mb other Public Domain or freeware software (including emacs).
it costs about 120 NLG (~ 40 USD), and is available to USENIX
members too from mcvax, or maybe from the USENIX office. 

The hack on this tape is hack.1.0.3 and runs on most unix systems.
There have been some problems reports for small SV systems, see
other articles in this newsgroups for further info.

tapes may be ordered from Frakn Kuiper, CWI, Kruislaan 413, NL-1098
SJ Amsterdam, Nederlands. or his email adr: frankk@mcvax.uucp


